      'The tradition\'s careful, transparent distinction between what the Quran itself confirms about Ilyas and the further, less certain material drawn from outside sources models the same methodological honesty found throughout serious Islamic scholarship: supplementary detail can inform understanding without being granted equal certainty to revealed text.',
